      "id": "iamwatch",
      "name": "IAMWATCH 2026",
      "venue": "The Singapore EDITION",
      "url": "https://www.iamwatch.com/event/2026/Home",
      "note": "Thu Nov 12 is invitation only. Dress code: \"Double-Wristed, Resort Casual.\" Print your event pass before you arrive — a photo is taken at registration for your pass. Program sessions are seated first come, first served. Arrive about 15 minutes before a session you want to attend; registering for a session does not reserve a seat. Sessions in the Penthouse are escorted. Meet at the IAMWATCH desk in the Level 1 lobby and the team will take you up.\n\nGeorge Daniels 100: The Genesis of Artisanal Watchmaking, presented by Phillips in Association with Bacs & Russo and The Hour Glass, is on view in the Boardroom throughout the fair: 22 of Daniels' watches, with Space Traveller I and Space Traveller II exhibited together for the first time. Public days Fri Nov 13 - Sun Nov 15, 11 AM-8 PM. Saturday afternoon is dedicated to Daniels, including the avant-premiere of the Phillips documentary on his life and work.",
