    {
      "id": "golden-hour",
      "name": "Golden Hour Singapore",
      "venue": "Casuarina Suite, Level 3, Raffles Hotel",
      "url": "https://goldenhour.delugs.com/singapore",
      "note": "Free entry; walk-ins welcome. The first 100 people through the doors each day get an exclusive Delugs tote bag. By appointment: Artime, Dominique Renaud and Renaud Tixier on Friday, Nov 13; Stéphane Pierre on Saturday, Nov 14 — book via their cards. On display: Fleming, Grönefeld, J.N. Shapiro, Kallinich Claeys, Romain Gauthier and Simon Brette.\n\nWatch Studies Live: watch photography sessions with Verne Ho of Watch Studies, covering lighting, positioning and composition. Saturday and Sunday, November 14–15, 11:00 AM–2:00 PM and 4:00–7:00 PM.\n\nGetting there: City Hall MRT (Exit A) is about a 6-minute walk, and Esplanade station is also nearby. Taxis and Grab drop off at the Seah Street entrance, and bus stops sit on North Bridge Road.",
