      "venue": "Glass Dome - Landmark of Good",
      "url": "https://www.spring-sprang-sprung.com/",
      "note": "Two Chat-Time talks: Art Meets Horology (Sat, Nov 14) and How Do You Build a Great Microbrand? (Sun, Nov 15) — both may be sold out. Two paid hands-on workshops run before doors open: Watchmaking Appreciation with WOSTEP-certified watchmaker Alvin Sim (Sat, Nov 14, 10 AM–1 PM, SGD 180, tools provided) and Watch Art by eight.past.ten, sketching and calligraphy with framed art to take home (Sun, Nov 15, 10–11 AM, SGD 30).",
