  "releases": [
    {
      "brand": "Awake",
      "brandKey": "awake",
      "eventId": "spring-sprang-sprung",
      "kind": "recent",
      "text": "Sơn Mài – Frosted Leaf \"Blood Moon\", \"Storm\" and \"Lagoon\" — Three new dials join Awake's Sơn Mài Frosted Leaf line: handcrafted Vietnamese lacquer over silver leaf, in red, teal and copper-orange. The 38mm steel case houses a La Joux-Perret G101 automatic. Around 100 pieces per color are made each year.\nPrice: €2,820 including taxes\n\nSơn Mài Silver Leaf — Awake's Sơn Mài rebuilt for a new generation: a 38mm steel case around dials of silver leaf under traditional Vietnamese lacquer, 15 hours of handwork each, powered by the La Joux-Perret G101 automatic with a 68-hour reserve. Java Green, Gentian Blue and Indian Red join the permanent collection; Purple Viola is limited to 200 pieces.\nPrice: €2,640",
      "url": null,
      "source": null,
      "awards": [],
      "images": [
