      "brand": "Minim",
      "brandKey": "minim",
      "eventId": "spring-sprang-sprung",
      "kind": "recent",
      "text": "Yang (Minim × L'Artisan) — A first-anniversary collaboration with Belgium's L'Artisan: a genuine rhodonite center dial and sub-seconds framed by a mother-of-pearl outer ring carrying Minim's Chinese numerals, in a 38mm steel case with a micro-rotor automatic movement, on a gray suede strap with pink stitching. Limited to 40 pieces.\nPrice: €1,049.49\nAvailability: Sold out.\n\nMN01 Sam1 Founder's Edition (Sam1 (charoite)) — A new Founder's Edition variant of the MN01, the Sam1, with a natural charoite stone centre dial, a brushed chapter ring with Chinese numerals and a purple guilloche outer dial. The 36.5mm steel case with a fluted bezel houses the hand-wound SW261-1M. Sold in person only, it debuts at Spring Sprang Sprung in Singapore on November 14-15, 2026.\nPrice: GBP 1,299",
      "url": null,
